        theory: ("{D} ran a roofing site without harnesses, and {V} fell and broke {V.his} back.", "{V} was offered safety equipment and refused it."),
        allocution: "\"I offered safety equipment on my site, and the roofer refused it. I've been in this courtroom before about worker safety, and I should have insisted. I'm sorry for the injury, and I'll make harnesses mandatory on every job.\"",
