        closings: ("A roofer fell and broke {V.his} back on {D}'s site. No harness was set up, and {D} had been cited before. This court first saw {DL} in {PRIORDATE} in the file for {PRIOR}. A boss decides whether a site is safe.", "A harness was in {D}'s truck and {V} refused it. {DL} offered the equipment and did not force it. The State has not shown culpable negligence by an employer who offered protection."),
