        defendant: [.direct("Did you set the fire?", "\"No. I never set that fire. I moved stock because I had a new space, and I'd never burn my own building.\""), .direct("Why did you move stock?", "\"I'd leased a larger space, and I was shifting inventory over a few days. I left old items behind that I planned to dispose of.\""), .direct("Who closed the sprinklers?", "\"A contractor who was testing the system. He closed the valve and told me he'd reopen it the next day.\""), .direct("Did you know the valve was closed?", "\"Yes, he told me. I assumed he would open it before leaving. I didn't check.\""), .direct("Where did the accelerant come from?", "\"I don't know. There was a gas can in the building for a mower, and that may be the explanation.\""), .direct("How do you feel about the fire?", "\"Sick. The neighbors lost a lot, and I'm sorry for their loss.\""), .cross("You have been in this court before about a fire, haven't you?", "\"Yes, I was here before about a fire, and I know it looks bad to see me again. I'm telling you what I know.\""), .cross("You moved the valuable stock before the fire, didn't you?", "\"Yes, I moved the valuable stock first, because the new space was ready and the best items needed the better storage.\""), .cross("You knew the sprinklers were closed, didn't you?", "\"Yes, the contractor told me, and I assumed he would reopen the valve before he left. I should have checked it myself.\""), .cross("The building was insured, wasn't it?", "\"Yes, the building was insured, as any business building is, and I told the fire marshal about the policy myself.\""), .cross("You stood to gain from the fire, didn't you?", "\"No, I did not stand to gain, because I'd already moved most of what mattered and the policy wouldn't cover what I lost in the move.\"")],
